 r←Test_Busy_002(stopFlag batchFlag);n;i;RunSetPercent;⎕TRAP;noOfThreads
⍝ Exercise `Busy`: The GUI runs in one thread, the `SetPercent` & `∆CloseForm` functions run in another.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 noOfThreads←⍴⎕TNUMS
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Busy.Create'This may take a moment...'
 ⎕FX'{r}←RunSetPercent n;i' 'r←⍬' ':For i :In 2+⍳9' '⎕DL 0.1' 'n #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Busy.SetPercent 10×i' ':EndFor' '⎕dl .2' 'n.∆CloseForm'
 {}{RunSetPercent ⍵}&n
 ⎕DL 2
 n.∆CloseForm
 →FailsIf noOfThreads≠⍴⎕TNUMS

 r←∆OK
